3. COMPLETE FEATURE & MODULE SPECIFICATION
📦 MODULE 1: Authentication & User Management
Feature	 Description	API Endpoint
User Registration	Sign up with email, password, name, age, gender	POST /api/auth/register
User Login	JWT-based login with access + refresh tokens	POST /api/auth/login
Token Refresh	Auto-refresh expired access tokens	POST /api/auth/refresh
Password Reset	Email-based password reset flow	POST /api/auth/reset-password
Profile Setup	Onboarding: height, weight, goals, dietary prefs, medical conditions	PUT /api/users/profile
Profile View	Get current user's complete profile	GET /api/users/me
Avatar Upload	Profile picture upload	POST /api/users/avatar

MODULE 2: AI Workout Planning
Feature	Description	API Endpoint
Generate Workout Plan	AI generates personalized weekly plan via Groq LLaMA-3.3-70B	POST /api/workouts/generate
Get Today's Workout	Fetch today's scheduled workout	GET /api/workouts/today
List All Plans	View all saved workout plans	GET /api/workouts/plans
Get Workout Detail	View specific workout with exercises	GET /api/workouts/plans/{id}
Log Workout	Mark workout as complete, log reps/sets/weight	POST /api/workouts/log
Exercise Videos	Fetch YouTube exercise demo videos	GET /api/workouts/videos/{exercise}
Custom Workout	Create custom workout manually	POST /api/workouts/custom
Sync to Calendar	Push workout schedule to Google Calendar	POST /api/workouts/sync-calendar

 MODULE 3: AI Nutrition Guidance
Feature	Description	API Endpoint
Generate Meal Plan	AI + Spoonacular generated meal plan based on goals/diet	POST /api/nutrition/generate
Get Today's Meals	Fetch today's meal recommendations	GET /api/nutrition/today
Search Recipes	Search recipes by name, ingredient, or diet type	GET /api/nutrition/recipes/search
Recipe Detail	Full recipe with nutrition breakdown	GET /api/nutrition/recipes/{id}
Log Meal	Log what the user ate with calorie tracking	POST /api/nutrition/log
Nutrition Summary	Daily/weekly calorie & macro summary	GET /api/nutrition/summary
Water Tracking	Log daily water intake	POST /api/nutrition/water
Get Alternatives	AI suggests food alternatives	POST /api/nutrition/alternatives

MODULE 4: Health Assessment & Vitals
Feature	Description	API Endpoint
Health Assessment	Comprehensive questionnaire (BMI, lifestyle, stress, sleep)	POST /api/health/assessment
Health Score	AI-calculated health score (0-100)	GET /api/health/score
BMI Calculator	Calculate BMI with categorization	POST /api/health/bmi
Log Vitals	Record BP, heart rate, blood sugar, sleep hours	POST /api/health/vitals
Vitals History	View vitals trend over time	GET /api/health/vitals/history
Health Recommendations	AI-generated health tips based on profile	GET /api/health/recommendations
Risk Assessment	AI assesses health risks from data	POST /api/health/risk-assessment

MODULE 5: Progress Tracking & Analytics
Feature	Description	API Endpoint
Dashboard Overview	Aggregated fitness stats (weekly/monthly)	GET /api/progress/dashboard
Weight Trend	Weight change graph over time	GET /api/progress/weight
Workout Analytics	Workout frequency, volume, streak	GET /api/progress/workouts
Nutrition Analytics	Calorie/macro tracking over time	GET /api/progress/nutrition
Goals Management	Set, update, track fitness goals	POST/GET /api/progress/goals
Achievements	Unlock badges for milestones	GET /api/progress/achievements
Weekly Report	AI-generated weekly progress summary	GET /api/progress/weekly-report

MODULE 6: AROMI AI Health Coach (Floating Chatbot)
Feature	Description	API Endpoint
Chat with AROMI	Real-time AI conversation via Groq LLaMA-3.3-70B	POST /api/ai/chat
Context-Aware	AROMI knows user's profile, history, and goals	(Auto-injected)
Quick Suggestions	Pre-built chips: "Suggest a workout", "What should I eat?"	(Frontend)
Chat History	Persistent conversation storage	GET /api/ai/history
Clear Chat	Clear conversation history	DELETE /api/ai/history
Adaptive Coaching	Adjusts tone/advice based on progress and mood	(AI logic)

AI System Prompt Template:
You are AROMI, an AI Health Coach for ArogyaMitra. You provide personalized 
fitness, nutrition, and wellness guidance. You are empathetic, motivating, 
and evidence-based.

User Profile:
- Name: {name}, Age: {age}, Gender: {gender}
- Height: {height}cm, Weight: {weight}kg, BMI: {bmi}
- Goal: {goal}, Activity Level: {activity_level}
- Dietary Preference: {diet}, Allergies: {allergies}
- Medical Conditions: {conditions}

Recent Activity:
- Last workout: {last_workout}
- Workout streak: {streak} days
- Average calories/day: {avg_calories}
- Health score: {health_score}/100

Guidelines:
- Always consider medical conditions and allergies
- Provide actionable, specific advice
- Encourage consistency and celebrate progress
- Never provide medical diagnoses - suggest consulting a doctor when needed
- Use a warm, supportive tone

MODULE 7: External API Integrations
Integration	Purpose	Key Features
Groq LLaMA-3.3-70B	AI brain for all intelligent features	Workout generation, meal planning, health coaching, recommendations
YouTube Data API v3	Exercise video tutorials	Search exercise demos, embed videos in workout cards
Spoonacular API	Nutrition & recipe database	Recipe search, nutrition info, meal planning, food alternatives
Google Calendar API	Schedule syncing	Push workout schedules to user's Google Calendar

5. TECH STACK DETAILS
Component	Technology	Version	Purpose
Backend Framework	FastAPI	0.109+	Async REST API
Python	Python	3.11+	Backend language
Database	MongoDB	7.0+	Document store
ODM	Motor (async)	3.3+	Async MongoDB driver
Auth	JWT (python-jose)	-	Token-based auth
Password	passlib[bcrypt]	-	Password hashing
AI	Groq SDK	Latest	LLaMA-3.3-70B access
Validation	Pydantic v2	2.5+	Data validation
Frontend	React.js	18+	UI framework
Build Tool	Vite	5+	Fast dev server
Styling	Tailwind CSS	3.4+	Utility-first CSS
UI Library	shadcn/ui + Lucide	Latest	Component library
Charts	Recharts	2.10+	Data visualization
State	Zustand	4.5+	State management
HTTP	Axios	1.6+	API requests
Routing	React Router v6	6.21+	Client-side routing
Notifications	React Hot Toast	2.4+	Toast notifications
Containerization	Docker + Compose	Latest	Deployment
📋 6. STEP-BY-STEP EXECUTION PLAN
🔷 EPIC 1: Project Setup & Configuration 
Step	Task	Details
1.1	Initialize Backend	Create backend/ folder, set up virtual env, install FastAPI, Motor, Groq SDK, python-jose, passlib, httpx
1.2	Initialize Frontend	npm create vite@latest frontend -- --template react, install Tailwind, Zustand, Axios, React Router, Recharts, Lucide
1.3	Configure .env files	Set up backend & frontend env files with API keys
1.4	MongoDB Setup	Install MongoDB locally or use Atlas, create arogyamitra database
1.5	Docker Setup	Create Dockerfiles for backend & frontend, docker-compose.yml
1.6	Test Setup	Run both servers, verify connectivity, test MongoDB connection
🔷 EPIC 2: Backend API Development 
Step	Task	Details
2.1	Database Layer	database.py with Motor async client, connection pooling
2.2	Auth System	Registration, login, JWT generation, middleware, password hashing
2.3	User Router	Profile CRUD, onboarding endpoint, avatar upload
2.4	Pydantic Models	All request/response schemas for every module
2.5	Workout Router	Generate plan, log workout, get plans, today's workout
2.6	Nutrition Router	Generate meal plan, log meal, search recipes, water tracking
2.7	Health Router	Assessment, BMI calc, vitals logging, health score
2.8	Progress Router	Dashboard data, weight trend, goals, achievements
2.9	Service Layer	Business logic for all routers (workout_service, nutrition_service, etc.)
2.10	Error Handling	Global exception handlers, validation error responses
EPIC 3: AI Integration & External APIs 
Step	Task	Details
3.1	Groq Client	Initialize Groq SDK, create reusable client with error handling & retry
3.2	AI Prompts	Craft system prompts for workout generation, meal planning, coaching
3.3	Workout AI	Connect Groq to generate personalized workout plans from user profile
3.4	Nutrition AI	AI-powered meal plans considering diet, allergies, goals
3.5	AROMI Coach	Context-aware chatbot: inject user profile + history into each prompt
3.6	YouTube Integration	Search exercise videos, return top 3 results per exercise
3.7	Spoonacular Integration	Recipe search, nutrition lookup, meal plan enrichment
3.8	Google Calendar	OAuth2 flow, push workout events to user's calendar
3.9	Health AI	AI-generated health recommendations and risk assessments
3.10	Weekly Report AI	Auto-generate weekly summary using progress data
🔷 EPIC 4: Frontend Development 
Step	Task	Details
4.1	Layout & Navigation	Navbar, Sidebar, responsive layout, routing setup
4.2	Landing Page	Hero section, features showcase, CTA buttons
4.3	Auth Pages	Login & Register pages with form validation
4.4	Dashboard Page	Overview cards, weekly chart, calorie tracker, streak counter, quick actions
4.5	Workout Page	Workout plan display, exercise cards with videos, log form, calendar view
4.6	Nutrition Page	Meal plan display, recipe search, meal logger, nutrient charts
4.7	Health Assessment Page	Multi-step health form, BMI calculator, vitals logger, health score display
4.8	Progress Page	Weight graph, workout analytics, goal tracker, achievements
4.9	Profile & Settings	Edit profile, change password, notification prefs, API key management
4.10	AROMI Chatbot	Floating chat widget (bottom-right), message bubbles, suggestion chips, typing indicator
4.11	Zustand Stores	Auth store, workout store, nutrition store, health store, progress store, chat store
4.12	API Service Layer	Axios instance with interceptors, auth header injection, auto token refresh
4.13	Responsive Design	Mobile-first approach, tablet & desktop layouts
🔷 EPIC 5: Integration, Testing & Polish 
Step	Task	Details
5.1	End-to-End Integration	Connect all frontend pages to backend APIs
5.2	Error Handling UI	Error boundaries, toast notifications, loading states
5.3	Backend Tests	pytest for auth, workouts, nutrition, AI endpoints
5.4	Frontend Testing	Component testing with Vitest
5.5	Performance	Lazy loading, code splitting, image optimization
5.6	Security Audit	CORS, rate limiting, input sanitization, env variable checks
5.7	Documentation	README, API docs, setup guide
5.8	Docker Deployment	Final docker-compose with all services

