📊 8. FRONTEND PAGE MAP
Code
/                       → LandingPage (public)
/login                  → LoginPage (public)
/register               → RegisterPage (public)
/dashboard              → DashboardPage (protected)
/workouts               → WorkoutPage (protected)
/workouts/:id           → WorkoutDetailPage (protected)
/nutrition              → NutritionPage (protected)
/nutrition/recipe/:id   → RecipeDetailPage (protected)
/health                 → HealthAssessmentPage (protected)
/progress               → ProgressPage (protected)
/profile                → ProfilePage (protected)
/settings               → SettingsPage (protected)
